1 // Number of lines
////////////////// 
////////////////// New line [1]
////////////////// 
1 // Type of line [1: Mooring, 2: Towing, 3:Tensor]
2 // Tension model [1: symmetric, 2: tension-only]
20 // Number of nodes used to divide catenary i
1 // Order of the elements of catenary i
125.0 // Length of catenary i 
169.3 // Weight over water of catenary i (kg/m)  
0.166 // Diameter of the section of catenary i  
6.6902E+08 // Youngs module multiplied by the Area for catenary i  
0.01 // Coefficient of the internal damping coefficient as function of EA [Azcona-2016] for i
0.0 // Coefficient of seabed static friction for i  
1.0 // Hydrodynamic Mass Coefficient for catenary i (needed for the dinamic model only)  
2.4 // Normal Drag Coefficient for catenary i (needed for the dinamic model only)  
1.15 // Tangential Drag Coefficient for catenary i (needed for the dinamic model only)  
300000.0 // Ground Nnormal sstiffnes for catenary ii (needed for the dinamic model only) [Palm-2013b]  
2000000.0 // Fraction of critical damping of ground for catenary ii (needed for the dinamic model only) [Palm-2013b]  
0.24 // Horizontal friction coefficient for catenary ii (needed for the dinamic model only) [Palm-2013b]  
0.01 // Horizontal cut-off velocity of friction for catenary ii (needed for the dinamic model only) [Palm-2013b]  
0.0 // Ground penetration depth for catenary ii (needed for the dinamic model only) [Palm-2013b]
3 // BCP index of the node with index N
1 // BCP index  of node with index 1 [IMPORTANTE, PONER AQUI EL PUNTO DE ABAJO]

